end

on mouseLeave
  [  0] pushint8 108 ............................ <108>
  [  3] pusharglist 1 ........................... <108>
  [  5] extcall 4 ............................... <sprite(108)>
  [  7] pushcons 40 ............................. <"bonz">
  [  9] pusharglist 1 ........................... <"bonz">
  [ 11] extcall 16 .............................. <cast("bonz")>
